  "full_passage_spoken": "We take a trip to a farm. We go by bus. I see a cow and a horse. I feed a chicken. I try fresh milk. I take a photo. Then we go home. It is a great trip. The bus is full of happy students. The horse is tall, and the cow is calm. A great trip gives us photos and fresh milk.",
